The video call with my family is over.
It is half past ten in the evening.
Now I am really tired.
I get up from the sofa.
I go into the bathroom.
There I wash myself.
I also brush my teeth.
Then I walk through the flat.
I turn off the light everywhere.
It is very dark and quiet now.
I go into my bedroom.
I go to bed.
I take my mobile phone.
I set the alarm for tomorrow.
Then I put the mobile phone on the table.
I close my eyes.
The day was long, but good.
I fall asleep quickly.
